<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Beckon is a non-sandboxed menu-bar app. With the hardened runtime enabled it needs no exceptions:
  no JIT, no unsigned executable memory, no dyld environment variables, no library validation bypass,
  and it talks to Claude Code over a Unix socket in ~/.beckon which is plain file I/O.
  Keep this dictionary empty unless a feature genuinely requires an entitlement.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
